      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3e8b470d_2bb518e5",
        "filename": "chip/g/usb-stream.c",
        "patchSetId": 12
      },
      "lineNbr": 264,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-20T16:34:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "here we should check if tx_in_progress is set, if so -just exit.\nthen check tx_fifo_is_ready() - if not - exit\nthen set tx_in_progress and call the handler.",
      "revId": "355fb38c1e979ae7d8b6ac29420a60960372a8c6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "05afefc3_3af0ac03",
        "filename": "chip/g/usb-stream.c",
        "patchSetId": 12
      },
      "lineNbr": 264,
      "author": {
        "id": 1283719
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-20T18:03:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Any gating checks should be located in tx_stream_handler() not outside, because it is not guaranteed that queue policy function shall be called in interrupt handler only.\nWe are planning to apply usb_stream on to usb_console.c (cr50 console), which has a null queue policy. usb_written() is never be called in that case. In ToT, console_task calls hook_call_deferred(config-\u003edeferred_tx, 0) directly.",
      "parentUuid": "3e8b470d_2bb518e5",
      "revId": "355fb38c1e979ae7d8b6ac29420a60960372a8c6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "83c247b0_c3f92541",
        "filename": "chip/g/usb-stream.c",
        "patchSetId": 12
      },
      "lineNbr": 264,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-20T18:27:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we can have usb_console check tx_in_progress just before calling tx_stream_handler() just as well.",
      "parentUuid": "05afefc3_3af0ac03",
      "revId": "355fb38c1e979ae7d8b6ac29420a60960372a8c6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
